# LongThink Learning Engine — Environment template (root)
# Copy per-service examples to their locations:
#   copy cloud\.env.example cloud\.env
#   copy local\.env.example local\.env
# Never commit real .env files (see .gitignore). See layout-rules 1.md §18, §22, §44.

# Quick start
#  1. .\INSTALL.bat  (creates both .env files automatically)
#  2. or: cloud\.env.example → cloud\.env, local\.env.example → local\.env

# See docs/deployment.md for production (Supabase/Railway/Fly/VPS) overrides.
